+// The Q8_0_R16 block layout and the VPDPBUSD inner loop are adapted from ik_llama.cpp
+// (https://github.com/ikawrakow/ik_llama.cpp) ggml/src/iqk/iqk_gemm_legacy_quants.cpp (mul_mat_q8_0_r16_q8_2,
+// iqk_convert_q80_q80_r16; #2764, #2807) and the work split from iqk_mul_mat.cpp (split_units_and_columns). The
+// activations here are the upstream Q8_0 rows ggml already quantized src1 into, not ik's Q8_2_X4.
